'''Ninjutsu Cute''' (忍法お色気の術, ''Ninpō Oiroke no Jutsu'', '''Ninja Appealing Technique''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

==Effect==
"Critical" Rate UP (Sm): [[Critical Hit]] chance for all cats that have the ability is increased by 1%.

