==Trivia==
*Ninjutsu Cute's Japanese name is identical to that of the [[wikia:naruto:Sexy Technique|Sexy Jutsu]] from ''[[wikipedia:Naruto|Naruto]]'', but with the word 忍法 ''ninpō'' (ninja arts) added in front.

